{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 19 08 2024, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 19 08 2024 and numbered SW/PLN/36/132/01; unnumbered location and block plans was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clause E(a) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the outbuilding would contain primary living facilities and would not be incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse.\r\n"
  ],
